and is fully equipped for a comfortable stay.\n\nIdeal for professionals, business travellers, project employees, commuters and anyone looking for temporary accommodation.\n\nApartment Features\n- Approx. 50 m2 living space\n- Separate living room and bedroom\n- Fully equipped kitchen\n- Refrigerator, oven, microwave and dishwasher\n- Washing machine\n- Coffee machine, kettle and kitchen utensils\n- Private bathroom with shower and toilet\n- Flat-screen TV and free Wi-Fi\n- Desk and dining area\n- Bed linen and towels provided\n- Private terrace and garden\n- Free private parking space\n- Ground-floor access with one step at the entrance\n- Non-smoking apartment\n\nLocation\nThe apartment is situated in a peaceful residential neighbourhood, close to green fields and the Enz River.\n- ALDI, Lidl, REWE and bakeries within walking distance\n- Vaihingen (Enz) railway station approximately 5 minutes by car or 10 minutes by bus\n- Convenient train connections to Stuttgart, Ludwigsburg, Bietigheim-Bissingen and Karlsruhe\n- Easy access to the B10 main road\n- Ideal for professionals working in the Stuttgart and Ludwigsburg regions\n\nRental Conditions\nMonthly All-Inclusive Rent:\n- 1 person: €1,000 per month\n- 2 persons: €1,100 per month\nThe rent includes electricity, heating, water, Wi-Fi and private parking.\nRental period: 1–12 months, subject to agreement and applicable legal requirements for temporary accommodation.\nSecurity deposit: €2,000 (refundable, subject to the rental agreement and any lawful deductions).\n\nContact\nIf you are interested, please send a short message including:\n- Number of occupants\n- Preferred move-in date\n- Intended rental period\n- Reason for your temporary stay\nViewings can be arranged by appointment.\nWe look forward to hearing from you!","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"